{"seq":2,"slug":"backpropagation-deep-dive","title":"反向传播算法深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/neural-network-foundations/backpropagation-deep-dive","wordCount":1311,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"反向传播算法深入\">反向传播算法深入</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>反向传播（Backpropagation）是训练神经网络的核心算法，通过链式法则高效计算损失函数对每个参数的梯度。它将一次前向传播的计算过程编码为有向无环图（计算图），然后从输出节点沿反方向逐层计算梯度，使得整个网络的梯度计算复杂度与前向传播处于同一量级。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 前向传播&#10;        X[&quot;输入 x&quot;] --&gt; Z1[&quot;z₁ = W₁x + b₁&quot;]&#10;        Z1 --&gt; A1[&quot;a₁ = f(z₁)&quot;]&#10;        A1 --&gt; Z2[&quot;z₂ = W₂a₁ + b₂&quot;]&#10;        Z2 --&gt; Y[&quot;ŷ = f(z₂)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    Y --&gt; L[&quot;损失 L(ŷ, y)&quot;]&#10;    subgraph 反向传播&#10;        L --&gt; DZ2[&quot;∂L/∂z₂&quot;]&#10;        DZ2 --&gt; DW2[&quot;∂L/∂W₂&quot;]&#10;        DZ2 --&gt; DA1[&quot;∂L/∂a₁&quot;]&#10;        DA1 --&gt; DZ1[&quot;∂L/∂z₁&quot;]&#10;        DZ1 --&gt; DW1[&quot;∂L/∂W₁&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 前向传播\n        X[\"输入 x\"] --&gt; Z1[\"z₁ = W₁x + b₁\"]\n        Z1 --&gt; A1[\"a₁ = f(z₁)\"]\n        A1 --&gt; Z2[\"z₂ = W₂a₁ + b₂\"]\n        Z2 --&gt; Y[\"ŷ = f(z₂)\"]\n    end\n    Y --&gt; L[\"损失 L(ŷ, y)\"]\n    subgraph 反向传播\n        L --&gt; DZ2[\"∂L/∂z₂\"]\n        DZ2 --&gt; DW2[\"∂L/∂W₂\"]\n        DZ2 --&gt; DA1[\"∂L/∂a₁\"]\n        DA1 --&gt; DZ1[\"∂L/∂z₁\"]\n        DZ1 --&gt; DW1[\"∂L/∂W₁\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>前向传播</th>\n<th>反向传播</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>计算方向</td>\n<td>输入 → 输出</td>\n<td>输出 → 输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心操作</td>\n<td>矩阵乘法 + 激活</td>\n<td>链式法则求导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据流</td>\n<td>激活值</td>\n<td>梯度值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储需求</td>\n<td>保存中间激活值</td>\n<td>复用前向存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算复杂度</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（与前向同阶）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目的</td>\n<td>计算预测值</td>\n<td>计算参数梯度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"计算图与链式法则\">计算图与链式法则</h2><p>计算图将复杂的数学表达式分解为基本操作节点的有向无环图。每个节点代表一个基本运算（加、乘、激活等），边代表数据流。链式法则的核心思想是：复合函数的导数等于各层函数导数的乘积。</p>\n<p>对于函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = f(g(x))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>，链式法则给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{dy}{dx} = \\frac{dy}{dg} \\cdot \\frac{dg}{dx}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2772em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4133em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2772em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9322em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。在多层网络中，这个法则被递归应用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def forward_pass(x, W1, b1, W2, b2):&#10;    z1 = W1 @ x + b1&#10;    a1 = np.maximum(0, z1)&#10;    z2 = W2 @ a1 + b2&#10;    a2 = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-z2))&#10;    return z1, a1, z2, a2&#10;&#10;def backward_pass(x, y, z1, a1, z2, a2, W1, W2):&#10;    m = x.shape[1]&#10;    dz2 = a2 - y&#10;    dW2 = (1 / m) * dz2 @ a1.T&#10;    db2 = (1 / m) * np.sum(dz2, axis=1, keepdims=True)&#10;    da1 = W2.T @ dz2&#10;    dz1 = da1 * (z1 &gt; 0).astype(float)&#10;    dW1 = (1 / m) * dz1 @ x.T&#10;    db1 = (1 / m) * np.sum(dz1, axis=1, keepdims=True)&#10;    return dW1, db1, dW2, db2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward_pass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x, W1, b1, W2, b2):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> W1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    a1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.maximum(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, z1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> W2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    a2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.exp(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">z2))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z1, a1, z2, a2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> backward_pass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x, y, z1, a1, z2, a2, W1, W2):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dz2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dW2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dz2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a1.T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    db2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sum(dz2, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">keepdims</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    da1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> W2.T </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dz2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dz1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> da1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (z1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).astype(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dW1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dz1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    db1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sum(dz1, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">axis</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">keepdims</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dW1, db1, dW2, db2</span></span></code></pre></div><p>计算图中存在两种求导模式。<strong>前向模式</strong>从输入开始逐层向前计算导数，适合输入维度小于输出维度的情况。<strong>反向模式</strong>从输出开始逐层向后计算导数，适合输出维度小于输入维度的情况。由于神经网络的输出（损失值）是标量，而参数数量巨大，反向模式在效率上有绝对优势——一次反向传播即可获得所有参数的梯度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"梯度消失与梯度爆炸\">梯度消失与梯度爆炸</h2><p>梯度在反向传播过程中逐层相乘。如果每层的梯度绝对值小于 1，经过多层累积，梯度会指数级衰减至接近零，这就是梯度消失。反之，如果每层梯度绝对值大于 1，梯度会指数级增长，导致梯度爆炸。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 梯度传播路径&#10;        L[&quot;损失层&quot;] --&gt; G5[&quot;第5层梯度&quot;]&#10;        G5 --&gt; G4[&quot;第4层梯度&quot;]&#10;        G4 --&gt; G3[&quot;第3层梯度&quot;]&#10;        G3 --&gt; G2[&quot;第2层梯度&quot;]&#10;        G2 --&gt; G1[&quot;第1层梯度&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    G1 --&gt; V{&quot;梯度消失?&lt;br/&gt;|grad| → 0&quot;}&#10;    G1 --&gt; E{&quot;梯度爆炸?&lt;br/&gt;|grad| → ∞&quot;}\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 梯度传播路径\n        L[\"损失层\"] --&gt; G5[\"第5层梯度\"]\n        G5 --&gt; G4[\"第4层梯度\"]\n        G4 --&gt; G3[\"第3层梯度\"]\n        G3 --&gt; G2[\"第2层梯度\"]\n        G2 --&gt; G1[\"第1层梯度\"]\n    end\n    G1 --&gt; V{\"梯度消失?&lt;br/&gt;|grad| → 0\"}\n    G1 --&gt; E{\"梯度爆炸?&lt;br/&gt;|grad| → ∞\"}</pre><p>梯度消失在使用 Sigmoid 或 Tanh 激活的深层网络中尤为严重。Sigmoid 的最大导数为 0.25，意味着 10 层网络中，第一层的梯度最多只有输出层的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0.25</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.25^{10} \\approx 10^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>主要原因</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>梯度消失</td>\n<td>浅层参数不更新</td>\n<td>饱和激活函数、网络过深</td>\n<td>ReLU、残差连接、BN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>梯度爆炸</td>\n<td>损失值 NaN</td>\n<td>权重过大、学习率过高</td>\n<td>梯度裁剪、权重初始化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>梯度裁剪（Gradient Clipping）是解决梯度爆炸最直接的方法。按范数裁剪将梯度向量的 L2 范数限制在阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 以内：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def clip_gradients(gradients, max_norm):&#10;    total_norm = np.sqrt(sum(np.sum(g ** 2) for g in gradients))&#10;    clip_coef = max_norm / (total_norm + 1e-6)&#10;    if clip_coef &lt; 1:&#10;        gradients = [g * clip_coef for g in gradients]&#10;    return gradients\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> clip_gradients</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(gradients, max_norm):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total_norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sqrt(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(np.sum(g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gradients))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    clip_coef </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (total_norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1e-6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clip_coef </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        gradients </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clip_coef </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gradients]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gradients</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"自动微分系统\">自动微分系统</h2><p>现代深度学习框架（PyTorch、JAX、TensorFlow）都实现了自动微分系统，使开发者无需手动推导梯度。自动微分不是数值微分（有限差分），也不是符号微分（公式化简），而是通过程序化追踪计算过程并应用链式法则的精确求导方法。</p>\n<p>PyTorch 采用<strong>动态计算图</strong>（Define-by-Run）：每次前向传播时动态构建计算图，反向传播后图即销毁。这种设计支持任意 Python 控制流（条件、循环），调试体验与普通 Python 程序一致。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;&#10;x = torch.tensor([2.0], requires_grad=True)&#10;W = torch.tensor([3.0], requires_grad=True)&#10;b = torch.tensor([1.0], requires_grad=True)&#10;&#10;z = W * x + b&#10;a = torch.relu(z)&#10;loss = (a - torch.tensor([5.0])) ** 2&#10;&#10;loss.backward()&#10;print(f&quot;dL/dW = {W.grad}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;dL/db = {b.grad}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;dL/dx = {x.grad}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.tensor([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">requires_grad</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">W </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.tensor([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">requires_grad</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.tensor([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">requires_grad</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> W </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.relu(z)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.tensor([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">loss.backward()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dL/dW = </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">W.grad</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dL/db = </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">b.grad</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dL/dx = </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x.grad</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>JAX 采用<strong>函数式自动微分</strong>，通过 <code>grad</code> 变换将一个函数转换为计算其梯度的函数。这种函数式设计天然支持高阶导数和向量化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import jax&#10;import jax.numpy as jnp&#10;&#10;def loss_fn(params, x, y):&#10;    W, b = params&#10;    z = W @ x + b&#10;    pred = jnp.maximum(0, z)&#10;    return jnp.mean((pred - y) ** 2)&#10;&#10;grad_fn = jax.grad(loss_fn)&#10;hessian_fn = jax.hessian(loss_fn)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jax</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jax.numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jnp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loss_fn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params, x, y):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    W, b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> params</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> W </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pred </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jnp.maximum(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, z)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jnp.mean((pred </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">grad_fn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jax.grad(loss_fn)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">hessian_fn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jax.hessian(loss_fn)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"反向传播的内存优化\">反向传播的内存优化</h2><p>反向传播需要保存前向传播的中间激活值用于梯度计算，这在大模型中会消耗大量显存。梯度检查点（Gradient Checkpointing）通过在反向传播时重新计算部分中间值来换取内存，是一种经典的时间换空间策略。</p>\n<p>基本思路是将网络划分为若干段，只保存每段的输入激活值。反向传播到某一段时，先重新执行该段的前向传播恢复中间值，再计算梯度。这样内存使用从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msqrt><mi>N</mi></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\sqrt{N})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1767em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但计算量增加约 33%。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;from torch.utils.checkpoint import checkpoint&#10;&#10;class LargeModel(torch.nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.block1 = TransformerBlock()&#10;        self.block2 = TransformerBlock()&#10;        self.block3 = TransformerBlock()&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        x = checkpoint(self.block1, x, use_reentrant=False)&#10;        x = checkpoint(self.block2, x, use_reentrant=False)&#10;        x = checkpoint(self.block3, x, use_reentrant=False)&#10;        return x\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.utils.checkpoint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> checkpoint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LargeModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">torch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#