3em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>~1.33x</td>\n<td>大模型训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合检查点</td>\n<td>可配置</td>\n<td>1-1.33x</td>\n<td>工程实践</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微批次累积</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N/k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>1x</td>\n<td>显存受限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((反向传播))&#10;    理论基础&#10;      计算图&#10;      链式法则&#10;      前向/反向模式&#10;    训练挑战&#10;      梯度消失&#10;      梯度爆炸&#10;      梯度裁剪&#10;    工程实现&#10;      自动微分&#10;      动态计算图&#10;      函数式微分&#10;    内存优化&#10;      梯度检查点&#10;      微批次累积\">mindmap\n  root((反向传播))\n    理论基础\n      计算图\n      链式法则\n      前向/反向模式\n    训练挑战\n      梯度消失\n      梯度爆炸\n      梯度裁剪\n    工程实现\n      自动微分\n      动态计算图\n      函数式微分\n    内存优化\n      梯度检查点\n      微批次累积</pre><ul>\n<li>反向传播通过链式法则在计算图上高效计算所有参数的梯度</li>\n<li>反向模式适合神经网络场景（标量输出、大量参数），一次反向传播获得所有梯度</li>\n<li>梯度消失源于饱和激活函数的小导数在深层网络中累积相乘</li>\n<li>梯度爆炸可通过梯度裁剪、合理的权重初始化和学习率控制来缓解</li>\n<li>现代框架的自动微分系统使开发者无需手动推导梯度</li>\n<li>梯度检查点通过重计算换内存，是大模型训练的标配技术</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"反向传播算法深入","id":"反向传播算法深入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"计算图与链式法则","id":"计算图与链式法则"},{"level":2,"text":"梯度消失与梯度爆炸","id":"梯度消失与梯度爆炸"},{"level":2,"text":"自动微分系统","id":"自动微分系统"},{"level":2,"text":"反向传播的内存优化","id":"反向传播的内存优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"激活函数与非线性变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/neural-network-foundations/activation-functions"},"next":{"title":"权重初始化策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/neural-network-foundations/weight-initialization"}}